# Keep line endings LF — in the repository and in every checkout.
#
# Without this, `core.autocrlf=true` (the Windows default) checks every file out
# as CRLF while oxfmt expects LF, so `vp check` reports the whole tree as
# mis-formatted on a fresh Windows clone. `text=auto` still detects binaries and
# leaves them alone.
* text=auto eol=lf
